-- analytics.talk: part of the broadcast-decision-reports-every-veto case
-- (ADR 0031). Grants come from case.toml: metrics: count (fire-and-forget)
-- Its clause isn't `, deciding`, so it hears every submit but allows it at
-- dispatch.

script variable seen = 0

on submit f
  tell metrics to count "submit"
  add 1 to seen
end submit
